+# S1P — offline tool runs
+
+**EVERY RUN RECORDED HERE IS OFFLINE. NO REAL SENDGRID PROVIDER CALL WAS MADE, BY ANY OF
+THEM, AT ANY POINT.**
+
+Following the convention of `S1M-gate-runs.md` and `S1N-tool-runs.md`: the commands a
+reviewer can re-run, and what they printed.
+
+---
+
+## 1. The live-validation harness, on a repository with no credentials
+
+```
